  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/6PkCWkC/xaeros-waystone-2.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/RjWCgrnBZz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1066142815043719208?color=7289da&label=Discord&logo=discord&logoColor=7289da&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"272\" height=\"41\"></span></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/xYmrwP9/description.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">🛈</span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"> <span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>Этот мод не поддерживает</strong></span> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap-fair-play-edition/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Xaero's Minimap (Fair-Play Edition)</strong></a><br></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><span><span><span><span style=\"font-size:36px\">🛈</span> Этот мод является преемником <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones2waypoints\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones2Waypoints</a>, который создаёт <strong>путевую точку&nbsp;</strong>на карте мира Xaero и в мини-карте Xaero при активации игроком Вехи.</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><span><span><span><span style=\"font-size:36px\">🛈</span> Требуется установка как на <strong>клиентскую, так и на серверную сторону<br></strong></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><span><span><span><span style=\"font-size:36px\">🛈</span> <span style=\"color:#f00\">Это не форк<span style=\"color:#000\">, </span></span><span style=\"color:#000\">поскольку предыдущий мод больше не развивается, мы создали новую версию для Forge 1.19.2, 1.19.3, 1.19.4, 1.20 и 1.20.1</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><span><span><span><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/dcZcCdK/banner-5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"94\"><br></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>Разработчики</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">🛈</span> shoqapik12: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.fiverr.com%252fshoqapik12\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ссылка на Fiverr</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmmcreviews.com%252fall%252fmods%252fxaeros-minimap-world-map-waystones-compatibility-forge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://150012028.v2.pressablecdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/mmcreview_banner_long.png\" alt=\"Отзывы о модах для Minecraft\" width=\"625\" height=\"104\"></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.kinetichosting.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:837px\" src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1133727001254039604/1470852110114357412/image.png?ex=698ec786&is=698d7606&hm=7ea2cfa9fafc9329f96c2ccf0370b9439dbd5abe9098be57dc7218c0694a734e&=&format=webp&quality=lossless\" alt=\"Изображение\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
